steps.text:
{
  "version": 1,
  "summary": "登录主入口是 POST /api/login，流程为按用户名查询用户、校验密码、记录成功或失败日志并返回基于用户 ID 拼接的会话字符串；同时存在通过反射调用 AuthService.authenticate 的遗留 JSP 和插件入口。",
  "coverage_note": "已检索登录 Controller、AuthService、UserMapper/LoginLogMapper 及其 MyBatis XML、密码校验器、遗留 JSP 和插件桥接代码；调用索引无边不代表运行时不存在其他调用方。",
  "context": {
    "question": "登录逻辑怎么实现的？调用了什么，被什么调用？读写哪些表？",
    "scope": "src/main/java/com/example/report/web、service、mapper、security、legacy、plugin，以及 src/main/resources/mapper；搜索词包括 login、登录、authenticate、findByUsername、matches、SELECT。"
  },
  "findings": [
    {
      "text": "HTTP 登录入口为 LoginController.login，映射到 POST /api/login，接收 LoginRequest，调用 AuthService.authenticate(username, password)，成功后将返回值封装为 LoginResponse。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:4141e35d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "核心认证流程先调用 UserMapper.findByUsername(username) 查询用户；用户不存在时写入 USER_NOT_FOUND 登录日志并抛出 IllegalArgumentException；用户存在但密码校验失败时写入 BAD_PASSWORD 日志并抛出同样的通用错误；校验成功时写入 SUCCESS 日志并返回 \"session-\" + user.id()。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "密码校验由 PasswordVerifier.matches(rawPassword, storedHash) 执行，但当前实现只判断 rawPassword 非空且长度等于 3，传入的 storedHash 没有参与实际比较。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:0f9da46f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "成功返回的所谓会话值只是内存中拼接出的字符串 \"session-\" + 用户 ID；已读取代码未发现该值写入数据库、缓存或 HTTP Session。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "遗留 JSP 入口 LegacyJspLogin.handleLogin 通过反射加载 AuthService、创建实例并反射调用 authenticate(username, password)。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:12842d4f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "插件入口 PluginLoginBridge.signIn 只有在配置 report.auth.plugin.enabled 等于 true 时才继续，否则抛出“插件登录未启用”；启用后同样通过反射调用 AuthService.authenticate。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:60e5ca60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "LegacyJspLogin 和 PluginLoginBridge 都通过无参构造反射创建 AuthService，而 AuthService 源码仅显示带 UserMapper、LoginLogMapper、PasswordVerifier 参数的构造器；因此这两个反射入口是否能在当前运行配置下成功实例化 AuthService 未确认，按源码推断可能触发构造失败。",
      "state": {
        "type": "inferred"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:12842d4f",
        "sr1:60e5ca60"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callers": [
    {
      "name": "LoginController.login",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/web/LoginController.java",
      "detail": "HTTP POST /api/login 直接调用 AuthService.authenticate。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:4141e35d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LegacyJspLogin.handleLogin",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/legacy/LegacyJspLogin.java",
      "detail": "通过反射获取 authenticate 方法并调用；当前索引未确认其上游 JSP/框架调用方。",
      "kind": "indirect",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:12842d4f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PluginLoginBridge.signIn",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/plugin/PluginLoginBridge.java",
      "detail": "配置 report.auth.plugin.enabled=true 时，通过反射调用 authenticate；当前索引未确认其上游插件调用方。",
      "kind": "indirect",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:60e5ca60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "HTTP 客户端或 Web 框架",
      "detail": "可确认 Controller 暴露了 POST /api/login，但源码检索未发现具体调用方。",
      "kind": "candidate",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:4141e35d"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callees": [
    {
      "name": "AuthService.authenticate",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/service/AuthService.java",
      "detail": "Controller、遗留 JSP 和插件桥接入口最终调用的核心认证方法。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:4141e35d",
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:12842d4f",
        "sr1:60e5ca60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UserMapper.findByUsername",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/mapper/UserMapper.java",
      "detail": "按 username 查询用户账号对象。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:57be4810"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PasswordVerifier.matches",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/security/PasswordVerifier.java",
      "detail": "比较原始密码与用户密码信息；当前实现实际只检查原始密码长度和非空。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:0f9da46f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoginLogMapper.insertLog",
      "relative_path": "src/main/java/com/example/report/mapper/LoginLogMapper.java",
      "detail": "记录 USER_NOT_FOUND、BAD_PASSWORD 或 SUCCESS 结果。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:b7f8d93b"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "data_accesses": [
    {
      "object": "report_user",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "read"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "每次调用 AuthService.authenticate 时，按 username = #{username} 查询"
      ],
      "access_method": "UserMapper.findByUsername；SELECT id, username, password_hash, status FROM report_user WHERE username = #{username}",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:81673c9b",
        "sr1:57be4810",
        "sr1:31d1bb3f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "report_login_log",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "用户不存在时插入 result=USER_NOT_FOUND",
        "密码校验失败时插入 result=BAD_PASSWORD",
        "密码校验成功时插入 result=SUCCESS"
      ],
      "access_method": "LoginLogMapper.insertLog；INSERT INTO report_login_log (username, result, created_at) VALUES (#{username}, #{result}, NOW())",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:be756e7e",
        "sr1:b7f8d93b",
        "sr1:31d1bb3f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "AuthService 返回的 \"session-\" + user.id() 字符串",
      "category": "unknown",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "仅在用户存在且密码校验成功时生成；当前代码只看到返回字符串，未看到实际持久化或缓存写入"
      ],
      "access_method": "AuthService.authenticate",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "title": "接收登录请求",
      "detail": "POST /api/login 接收用户名和密码。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:4141e35d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "title": "查询用户",
      "detail": "调用 UserMapper.findByUsername，按用户名读取 report_user。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:81673c9b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "title": "处理用户不存在",
      "detail": "插入 USER_NOT_FOUND 登录日志，然后抛出通用用户名或密码错误。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:be756e7e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "title": "校验密码",
      "detail": "调用 PasswordVerifier.matches；当前实现要求原始密码非空且长度为 3。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:0f9da46f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "title": "处理密码错误",
      "detail": "插入 BAD_PASSWORD 登录日志，然后抛出通用用户名或密码错误。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:be756e7e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "title": "记录登录成功",
      "detail": "插入 SUCCESS 登录日志。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:be756e7e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "title": "生成并返回会话值",
      "detail": "返回 \"session-\" + user.id() 并由 Controller 封装为 LoginResponse。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:31d1bb3f",
        "sr1:4141e35d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "title": "遗留 JSP 兼容入口",
      "detail": "通过反射调用 AuthService.authenticate。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:12842d4f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "title": "插件登录入口",
      "detail": "配置开关关闭时失败；开启时通过反射调用 AuthService.authenticate。",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:60e5ca60"
      ]
    }
  ],
